}

{
  "analysis": "The apt install failed because there's not enough free space in /var/cache/apt/archives/ (211 MB needed). I need to free up space or find another approach. Let me check disk space and clean apt caches.",
  "plan": "Check disk space with df. Clean up apt cache and any temp files. If space is still tight, I may need a lightweight approach. Let me first assess the situation.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "df -h / /tmp /var; echo '---'; ls -la /var/cache/apt/archives/\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The filesystem shows 955G used, 0 available (100%). The apt install needs 211MB archives + 724MB installed, which won't fit. I need to free space or find lighter alternatives. Let me investigate what's consuming disk and clean up.",
  "plan": "Check what's using space with du on common large directories. Clean apt cache and any large temp files. Then decide on a lighter install strategy. I may need to install tools to a location with space, or clean aggressively.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "du -sh /usr /var /root /tmp /opt 2>/dev/null; echo '---'; apt-get clean; echo cleaned\n",
      "duration": 5.0
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The df output is misleading - it shows fuse-overlayfs at 955G used / 0 available, but actual disk usage (du) is only ~179M across the whole system. This is an overlayfs reporting quirk. The apt error about 'not enough free space' may be a false report. Let me verify actual writable space by probing, then retry. I also need yt-dlp (pip) for downloading.",
  "plan": "Probe real writable space with a test file write. Then retry apt install now that cache is cleaned. If apt still refuses due to its space check, I'll point apt's cache elsewhere or use pip-based alternatives (imageio-ffmpeg, pytesseract needs the binary though). First, let me test actual write capacity.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "df -i /; echo '---'; fallocate -l 100M /tmp/probe_test 2>&1; echo \"exit:$?\"; ls -la /tmp/probe_test; rm -f /tmp/probe_test\n",
      "duration": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

